{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318210/extras/1182f22af42cf0d376dbdec8b8a0387f.poster.avif?t=1772960459\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318210/extras/1182f22af42cf0d376dbdec8b8a0387f.webm?t=1772960459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318210/extras/1182f22af42cf0d376dbdec8b8a0387f.mp4?t=1772960459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300cThere are real friends in the online world too!\u300d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, Jin Dayeon, is an enthusiastic otaku of the Japanese game <i>Idol\u2606Star</i>, which features idol characters. One day, while playing the game with her friends as usual, she hears that a limited-edition character perfume for <i>Idol\u2606Star</i> will be released exclusively in Japan. In a spur of the moment, she ends up taking charge of organizing a group purchase for the perfume. However, in a fit of impulse, she uses all the collected money for personal purposes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318210/extras/0a4a18ac7fa66defaf7f518b5805b3f5.poster.avif?t=1772960459\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318210/extras/0a4a18ac7fa66defaf7f518b5805b3f5.webm?t=1772960459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318210/extras/0a4a18ac7fa66defaf7f518b5805b3f5.mp4?t=1772960459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only 14 days left until the deadline to order the <i>Idol\u2606Star</i> perfume group purchase... Can the protagonist raise 5 million won again in 14 days and place the order?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318210/extras/deac253b312959f5843e50884d48bdaa.poster.avif?t=1772960459\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318210/extras/deac253b312959f5843e50884d48bdaa.webm?t=1772960459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318210/extras/deac253b312959f5843e50884d48bdaa.mp4?t=1772960459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether to lead her to ruin or help her reform and become a respectable member of society depends on the player's choices. Enjoy various thrilling endings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>~Features~</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318210/extras/42a73e3dbfc22fc4580e148538ad3168.poster.avif?t=1772960459\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318210/extras/42a73e3dbfc22fc4580e148538ad3168.webm?t=1772960459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318210/extras/42a73e3dbfc22fc4580e148538ad3168.mp4?t=1772960459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a variety of mini-games in both the real and cyber worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><